["https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/HashAlgorithm/sha3_384", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "SHA-3 with a digest length of 384, as defined in [FIPS 202](https://csrc.nist.gov/pubs/fips/202/final).", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
